{"id":"e36ff0da02f94e7a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md","title":"Lévy Canonical Measure","display":"df-levy-canonical — Lévy Canonical Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-levy-canonical","aliases":["58-df-levy-canonical"],"display":"df-levy-canonical — Lévy Canonical Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-levy-canonical"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-levy-canonical</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-levy-canonical — Lévy Canonical Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dedfc8e5804658ad\" href=\"?note=dedfc8e5804658ad\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> (measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\})\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\})\\)</span> (Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S\\)</span> (Lévy-measure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}canonical} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S(\\nu,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\bigl(\\nu,\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\},\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\})\\bigr)\\land\\int_{\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\min(1,\\|x\\|^2)\\,\\nu(dx)&lt;\\infty\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}canonical} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S(\\nu,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\bigl(\\nu,\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\},\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\})\\bigr)\\land\\int_{\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\min(1,\\|x\\|^2)\\,\\nu(dx)&lt;\\infty\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The measure structure and Borel domain are explicit; because the domain excludes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>, a separate clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu(\\{0\\})=0\">\\(\\nu(\\{0\\})=0\\)</span> is unnecessary.</li>\n<li>It describes the jump part of Lévy processes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"dedfc8e5804658ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-borel-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ (measure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}canonical} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S(\\nu,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\bigl(\\nu,\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\},\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\})\\bigr)\\land\\int_{\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\min(1,\\|x\\|^2)\\,\\nu(dx)<\\infty","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu(\\{0\\})=0","display":false}],"bytes":1161,"backlinks":[{"id":"50ccecf2bfaccddf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md]])"},{"id":"cbddf9eabf158853","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2$ is the predicate from [[../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-771","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md|58-df-levy-canonical]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","dedfc8e5804658ad"]}